        "description": "Low nasal nitric oxide levels",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of chronic rhinosinusitis plus abnormal ciliary function or biallelic pathogenic variants in PCD genes",
    "notes": "Diagnosis often requires a combination of clinical, functional, and genetic testing."
